Description: panvk/jm: compute the index range inline for small direct indexed draws
 vkCmdDrawIndexed goes through the indirect path and searched the whole
 index buffer. Search only the draw's indices, and for up to 4096 indices
 compute min/max in the draw helper instead of a separate search job.
Author: pocket-debs
Origin: https://github.com/masterxq/mesa-lisbon (branch lisbon/26.3)
Forwarded: no
License: MIT (as the patched files)
Last-Update: 2026-11-25
